1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,920
Thirty-two seconds. That is how long Air

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,690
India Flight 171 was in the air.

3
00:00:06,216 --> 00:00:07,676
Thursday, the twelfth of June,

4
00:00:07,676 --> 00:00:10,626
2025. Ahmedabad, Gujarat.

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:15,200
230 passengers and 12 crew boarded a Boeing

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,790
787 Dreamliner, bound for London Gatwick.

7
00:00:19,146 --> 00:00:22,406
The aircraft, VT-ANB, had flown with Air

8
00:00:22,406 --> 00:00:23,996
India since 2014.

9
00:00:24,458 --> 00:00:26,588
At 1:38 in the afternoon,

10
00:00:26,978 --> 00:00:28,648
it lifted off from runway 23.

11
00:00:29,354 --> 00:00:31,394
Three seconds later, the flight recorder

12
00:00:31,394 --> 00:00:34,394
logged both engine fuel switches moving

13
00:00:34,394 --> 00:00:36,234
from RUN to CUTOFF,

14
00:00:36,234 --> 00:00:37,284
one second apart.

15
00:00:37,995 --> 00:00:39,205
On the cockpit recording,

16
00:00:39,715 --> 00:00:42,035
one pilot asks the other why he cut off

17
00:00:42,035 --> 00:00:44,265
the fuel. The other says he did not.

18
00:00:44,709 --> 00:00:47,269
The switches were moved back to RUN.

19
00:00:47,269 --> 00:00:48,799
The engines tried to relight.

20
00:00:49,029 --> 00:00:50,339
Then, a mayday call.

21
00:00:51,086 --> 00:00:52,836
Thirty-two seconds after takeoff,

22
00:00:53,286 --> 00:00:55,986
the jet came down on a medical college hostel,

23
00:00:55,986 --> 00:00:58,856
1.7 kilometres from the runway.

24
00:00:59,643 --> 00:01:02,403
241 people on board were killed,

25
00:01:02,403 --> 00:01:04,153
and 19 on the ground.

26
00:01:04,763 --> 00:01:06,903
One passenger, in seat 11A,

27
00:01:06,903 --> 00:01:07,393
survived.

28
00:01:08,283 --> 00:01:10,603
The preliminary report found no mechanical

29
00:01:10,603 --> 00:01:13,893
fault. It did not say why the switches moved.

30
00:01:14,617 --> 00:01:17,607
260 lives. Thirty-two seconds.

31
00:01:18,037 --> 00:01:19,987
The final answer is still awaited.

